WEBVTT

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:35.130
Today we find ourselves in 
the Hidden Sand Village,

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:36.950
far, far away from the Hidden Leaf.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:40.190
There are ninja villages 
in other countries, too,

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:43.240
but the Leaf and Sand are 
especially close allies.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:49.120
And that's why Rock Lee and his team are
visiting the Hidden Sand on a mission.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:51.980
We should be there any minute now.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.990
Huh? What's that?

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:23.530
<b>I want to be friends with Gaara!</b>

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:25.910
Oh, it's you.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.740
I thought you were enemy shinobi.

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:29.500
For those not aware,

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.490
this is Gaara, the Kazekage,

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:34.220
otherwise known as the Hidden 
Sand's leader and top ninja.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:37.840
Gaara and Lee once met in battle.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.360
Lee went so far as to sacrifice his 
safety to use a forbidden move,

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:43.300
but still lost and suffered 
severe injuries as a result.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:48.220
G-Gaara... Nice to see you again...

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:49.890
You're too nervous,
you're gnashing your teeth!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:53.360
I may have lost when we fought that day,

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.500
but I've been working hard.

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:57.920
I won't lose next time!

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:00.560
Follow me.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:01.860
Ignored?!

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.600
He doesn't even see you as an opponent.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.740
Well, Gaara is the Kazekage after all.

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:10.040
Don't be sad.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:18.710
Now, about this mission.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:22.390
We've got word rogue ninjas 
have infiltrated the village,

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:25.000
and I want your help 
in rooting them out.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.680
You can count on us.
We'll do everything we can.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:31.660
<i>Maybe Lee still has a 
grudge against Gaara?</i>

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.900
<i>He injured him so badly back then,
and completely brushed him off today.</i>

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:38.350
<i>And Lee's been glaring at him...</i>

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.740
Too close, too close!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.690
What're you doing to Gaara?!

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.550
Temari, Kankuro!

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.850
For those not aware,
this is Temari and Kankuro,

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:53.450
Gaara's older sister and older brother.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.630
Don't try anything with 
our Kazekage, 'kay?

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.380
Sheesh.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.380
What do you mean, try anything?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.760
I thought he was about 
to steal my first kiss!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.130
Enough!

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:07.600
You're acting weird, Lee, 
you should be apologizing!

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.440
Come on, I'll apologize with you.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.660
I apologize, 'kay?

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.830
Sorry, 'kay?

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.370
Don't copy me!

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:17.550
And that wasn't an apology!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:19.270
You didn't mean it!

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:22.080
Something's definitely 
up with Lee today.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.550
Yeah, he's being an instigator.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:27.490
Not the kind of cooperation we need.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.950
Don't worry, I've got a good idea.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.410
An idea?

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.180
Welcome to the 138th Annual...

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:43.590
<b>Welcome to the 138th Annual Leaf vs. Sand 
Alliance Building Barbecue Cook-Off!</b>

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:43.590
<b>And more!</b>

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:40.920
...Leaf vs. Sand Alliance
Building Barbecue Cook-Off!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.590
And more!

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:45.300
Why a barbecue?

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:46.730
You don't know?

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:47.850
Nope.

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:51.980
Barbecues, a summer tradition 
when students come together,

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:53.650
mess up the riverbank,

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:56.920
and let their youthful passion
burn along with their cheap beef!

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:59.860
That really doesn't sound very nice.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:05.220
And also an arena where boring 
fathers everywhere fight...

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:08.950
...for their wives' attention 
and children's respect!

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:12.540
Stop making barbecues sound so awful!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:15.690
The point is, barbecues are events...

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.470
...where both bored students 
and boring families...

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:20.790
...can get jazzed up and learn 
to get along with each other!

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:26.000
So then, the plan is to have Lee and
Gaara clear the air at a barbecue, then?

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.740
Will you help us?

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.080
Do we have a choice?

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:30.720
You're sure this'll work?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:33.850
Absolutely, leave it all to me.

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:38.400
Lee, Gaara, the food's cooked!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.150
I think this guy's more 
well done than the food.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:46.520
Lee, Gaara, how intense 
are these flames?!

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:48.080
It's intense all right.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.070
Especially his moves.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.060
Lee, Gaara, how about a spit roast?!

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:56.740
Look at the pig spin! How fun is this?!

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.370
He's spinning even faster.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:03.000
I think his brains are 
more roasted, too.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.050
It's no good.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:10.980
Normally he'd go along with 
Guy Sensei's foolishness...

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:11.810
We'll have to quit.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:13.120
At this point,

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.960
we need the big guns.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:16.180
Time for something drastic!

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:18.010
Let's dance!

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.850
Let your hearts burn with the flames...

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.640
...of youth and dance, dance, 
dance the night away!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.260
What happened to the barbecue?!

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:29.260
Do you want to do a summer 
anime ending, is that it?!

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:30.280
Kinda...

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.680
I fear for the Leaf's future.

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:43.490
Infiltration successful! 
Let's wreck this town!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:47.860
He's here.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:53.740
You're the rogue ninjas 
targeting my village?

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:57.270
Gaara, I'm going to beat 
more of them than you!

00:06:57.640 --> 00:07:00.230
<i>Lee's still fussing about 
Gaara at a time like this?</i>

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.150
<i>I won't lose this time.</i>

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.740
What're you doing?

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:10.960
I'm faster than his sand.

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.990
You are! You are, but who cares?!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:17.750
<i>Lame!</i>

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.320
What's with them?

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.160
Get 'em!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.670
Sand Coffin!

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.340
Can't... move...

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.170
I'll do it, too!

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:30.510
<b>Sand Squeeze</b>

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.440
Sand Squeeze!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:31.970
<b>Sand Squeeze</b>

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:34.180
What the heck are you doing?!

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:35.800
Sand Shower!

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:40.180
I'll show you...

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:41.630
Sweat Shower!

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:43.150
Ew, that's nasty!

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:44.880
Gross!

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:48.510
I'm pelting them with 
refreshing, youthful sweat!

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:51.530
That's not refreshing, it's disgusting!

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:53.950
<i>I can't use any big 
moves in the village.</i>

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.990
<i>I'll have to fight with 
just the sand in my gourd.</i>

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.700
Keep it up, Lee!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.290
Go!

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.880
Gaara's sand hit Lee by mistake!

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:11.050
<i>But the Kazekage's still calm and
collected, even though he missed...</i>

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.030
S-Sorry...

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.410
<i>The Kazekage's sweating!</i>

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:19.010
<i>Sweating so much his 
sand armor's cracking!</i>

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:21.930
I... I'm fine.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.810
Your hand!

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:27.980
Fall back. You can't 
fight with that injury.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:29.250
No.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:32.440
What?

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:36.070
Why are you pushing yourself so hard?

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:40.150
Yeah, why do you keep 
trying to one-up Gaara?

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:42.170
Even if you do resent him...

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.210
Resent?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.220
I don't resent Gaara at all.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:53.120
When I fought him,

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:58.870
I was injured so badly I thought
I'd have to quit being a ninja.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:01.620
But...

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.340
<i>If you lose your dream,</i>

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:05.390
<i>you'll suffer even more than you are now.</i>

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.950
<i>Get the surgery, Lee!</i>

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:12.570
I have reawakened so that I can 
keep chasing my dream.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.640
I'm not competing with 
Gaara out of anger.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:20.780
I'm doing it because I'm 
following my own "ninja way."

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:25.040
To prove that with enough hard work,
 I can overcome a genius!

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.750
That's why I'll beat you!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:30.210
<i>So that's it.</i>

00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:35.840
<i>Well, I talk big,</i>

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:39.620
<i>but I've tried forever to think 
of a way to surpass Gaara,</i>

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.460
<i>and still can't come up with anything.</i>

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.600
<i>I may just have to resign myself－</i>

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:45.390
Wait, Lee.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:49.970
I'm... I'm sorry for thinking
so little of my star pupil.

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:50.980
Guy Sensei.

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:54.900
You're living life to the fullest!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.200
You're glowing!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.600
I'm so moved I can't sit still!

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:00.660
You call that moved?!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.160
And that's so inappropriate!

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.120
Guy Sensei!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.280
Ah, yes...

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:09.000
That's it!

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:11.290
Sand Coffin!

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.160
Leaf Sandstorm!

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:19.930
He hijacked the sand!

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:29.310
You certainly have moved above Gaara!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.870
Not how he wants!

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:33.530
He's literally above him!

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:40.000
I thank the Leaf for its aid.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.130
Gaara, you really are amazing.

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:45.790
It's really thanks to 
you that we beat them.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:49.070
But I made a promise with 
the nice-guy pose,

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:51.710
so I will surpass you with 
hard work one of these days!

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.210
Let's face each other again someday!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:56.380
Sure...

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:58.040
You got it.

00:10:58.040 --> 00:10:59.220
Promise.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.090
Gaara!

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.380
Enough already!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.770
What's wrong with you, Lee?!

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:24.370
It's a razor-thin line between 
refreshing and sweltering.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:28.000
But today, Rock Lee got a 
little closer to Gaara.

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.210
One day,

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.840
on the way back from a mission.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.850
Someone's coming.

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:44.920
Make sure you greet him.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.650
It's a mountain climber custom.

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:47.510
Is it?

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.060
Understood.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.850
I'm ready to exchange business 
cards and phone numbers.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.610
That's a businessman!

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.830
Bill Gates and Steve Jobs 
climbed the corporate mountain...

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.190
...to the very peak of the business world.

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:03.610
How high are you trying to climb?!

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:07.350
Good afternoon!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:21.760
<b>The Rock Lee Impostor Strikes!</b>

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:24.720
Huh?

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.930
So he ran as soon as he saw you?

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.340
Yeah...

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:29.260
And then...

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:35.900
While we were walking though 
a town on the way back,

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.100
everyone panicked as soon 
as they laid eyes on me.

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:42.280
I don't understand why people I 
don't know are so scared of me.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:46.070
Maybe they're scared this shady-looking 
dude is walking around town.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.970
Oh man. What about me 
is shady or suspicious?

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.430
I'm as pure and innocent 
as a newborn babe.

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:53.940
What's shady is your ability 
to instantly strip naked...

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.580
...in broad daylight, and in public!

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.040
I figured it out.

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:00.940
A Lee impostor?

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:02.460
Exactly.

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.920
Apparently someone who 
looks just like Lee...

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:10.160
...has been running amuck doing terrible
things the people of that town.

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:15.270
You say terrible, but they 
all seem pretty dumb.

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:18.990
But why would someone run around 
impersonating Bushy-Brows?

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:20.120
Publicity?

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:21.420
No, maybe piggybacking.

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:21.980
Huh?

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:26.120
Looks like, now that the show is 
starting to get popular,

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.620
we've got phonies trying to 
piggyback off our success.

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:29.950
That's a stupid reason.

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:32.450
Because we're starting to get popular?

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:36.060
That's making a mockery of the
long grind our staff has to work!

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:37.320
He's gonna get it!

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:38.830
That's what you're mad about?!

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:44.430
Anyways, I'll take care of this fake.

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:46.760
I'll give you a hand.

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:48.970
Thanks, Naruto.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:52.710
There's no guarantee 
we'll find him easily.

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:55.150
We'll need to work hard and be vigilant.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:59.520
According to what I learned,
he's just like Lee in every way.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.210
In every way...

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.580
I got it!

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:11.860
Get back here!

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:13.910
No!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.950
<i>Why does it always have to be me?</i>

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:20.710
Help me!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.710
That's enough running.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.170
The magistrate wants you for himself!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.880
<i>Peek-a-boo!</i>

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:34.650
I see, if he really is just like you,
he'll definitely show up here.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:35.850
Good thinking, Naruto!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.720
How's that? Feeling 
less constipated yet?

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:40.590
No!

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:42.780
<i>What the heck is he doing now?</i>

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.750
Freeze, ruffian!

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.320
That's him! Get him, Lee!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:51.180
I, Rock Lee, may be a ninja 
that can't use ninjutsu,

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:54.990
but I will not stand by 
while the weak are bullied!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:58.740
What is the point if the 
real you shows up?!

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:01.920
You're right! I was drawn 
in by their amazing acting!

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:04.500
It's all for nothing if 
you reveal yourself.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.380
But you revealed yourself, too.

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.380
It's your fault!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:09.210
Uh...

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.060
Should we, um...

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:13.760
Freeze, ruffian!

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.650
It's the fake!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:22.000
I, Sock Lee, may be a ninja 
that can't use ninjutsu,

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.650
but I will not stand by 
while the weak are bullied!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.330
<i>He's got the same clothes,
but he looks nothing like Lee!</i>

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.740
<i>And did he call himself Sock Lee?</i>

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:32.900
W-Wow, it's the real thing!

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:35.160
Did you come here to take me down?

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:39.230
That's right. You're 
ruining Lee's good name!

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:42.190
Of course, since you look 
nothing alike, I guess we don't－

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:44.220
Wow, he really is the spitting image!

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:45.360
Crazy!

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.800
Your eyesight is what's crazy!

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:55.800
Is there a mirror here?

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:57.310
Not you, too!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.020
Snap out of it!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:15:59.270
Argue!

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.520
Anyway, you won't escape!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:06.420
You're serious, huh?

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.480
All right...

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.400
Reji, Zenzen!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.030
Don't tell me...

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:18.290
No resemblance!

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:21.560
Hey, Boss, can you man 
the register for a sec?

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:24.210
He just works a store 
register, so he's Reji?

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:27.090
This one doesn't look 
anything like you, Tenten!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.050
Not one bit.

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:31.110
So Zenzen didn't take it any 
further than a similar name.

00:16:31.110 --> 00:16:33.880
I need to teach them to put more 
effort into their disguises!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:37.000
Like here, we need to 
reduce the bust a lot,

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.310
and straighten out these curves－

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.020
That's the rudest advice 
I've ever heard!

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.280
With such bad teamwork,

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:46.760
who could tell the real from the fake?

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:49.650
We'll defeat you and 
assimilate your names.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.540
Wise guy...

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.570
You're on. Let's rock!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.650
I'll rip your guts out!

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:59.330
That's so childish!

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.750
Face the wrath of my secret move!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:03.450
Get ready, Bushy-Brows.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.540
He probably uses the 
same attacks as you!

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.220
Lee doesn't have moves like that!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:19.140
That's right out of a battle 
anime from last century!

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:22.170
Lee!

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:22.930
Oh no!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:24.610
Fight back, Lee!

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:28.770
If you use your best moves, 
there's no way you'll lose to that fake!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:32.190
Got it. My best moves...

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.900
Extending punch!

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:38.570
It didn't extend. 
That's not even your move!

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:42.170
Hey, Boss, I got hair extensions.
 Whatcha think?

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:43.910
Hair extensions don't count!

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:46.140
You're quick with the punchlines, huh?

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:47.830
You need to be, too,
 if you're mimicking me!

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:49.880
This is the end!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.550
Shimura Death Strike!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.340
Baddabing.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.860
That had to hurt!

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:01.680
This... is so wrong, 
but I can't make a joke...

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.930
I have won.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.180
At this rate I'll lose.
 What do I do...

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:09.940
What's wrong with you, Lee?!

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:12.620
You can't lose!

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.360
The real one can't lose to a fake!

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:16.780
Tenten... Neji...

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.920
Remember the bonds between you,

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.910
and you can't lose!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:26.290
My... bonds with Tenten and Neji...

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:33.750
<i>I need toilet paper!</i>

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.300
<b>Toilet Paper
(Two-Ply♥)</b>

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:36.570
<i>Tools, T.P. Summoning Jutsu!</i>

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.260
<i>That enough for you?</i>

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.590
<i>Well?</i>

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.350
Why are you remembering the bathroom?!

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:49.730
Don't you have any nicer memories?!

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:51.250
No.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:54.820
Helping a friend through such 
a painful, trying situation...

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.580
That's a true bond!

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:59.570
Some phony who's never experienced 
that can't beat me!

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.490
Back for more?

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.720
A fake is just that, a fake.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:16.060
Top-secret move!
 "Often Imitated, Never Duplicated!"

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:24.340
<b>Often Imitated, Never Duplicated!</b>

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:21.370
Morning Peacock featuring Rock Lee!

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:22.970
Morning Chicken!

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:29.450
Lee!

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:30.810
Tenten, Neji!

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.770
<i>Too much! This is weird!</i>

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:36.240
I couldn't beat the real Lee.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:39.310
I'll never be a ninja.

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:40.760
Say what?

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:45.200
I used to want to be a ninja even
though I can't use ninjutsu, too.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.660
One day I learned about Rock Lee,

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.810
another man who can't use ninjutsu,

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.630
yet aims to become a 
splendid ninja regardless.

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:57.670
But I don't have any 
friends to train with,

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:59.800
or a sensei to push me...

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:04.150
So I got jealous, and started 
doing bad things.

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.220
So that's what this is all about?

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:12.690
Then I hired Reji and 
Zenzen for about 850 yen.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.690
Hey, Boss, are we fired?

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.900
I expect every bit of my share.

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:21.510
Seeing the close relationship between you
and your comrades has opened my eyes.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:24.540
A physical resemblance 
doesn't mean anything.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.910
I'll learn from this 
experience and keep trying!

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:31.460
Causing mischief while posing 
as someone else is wrong,

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.490
but learning through imitation 
can be necessary sometimes.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:36.040
Take your cues from Bushy-Brows 
and you'll be fine.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.560
You may not look like him,

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:40.560
but you're both in the same boat 
not being able to use ninjutsu.

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:44.510
No, this man and I are very different.

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:47.590
I've been blessed with 
wonderful friends,

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:50.260
but he's always been alone.

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:53.890
In that sense, he's stronger than me.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.230
The real Lee...

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.990
So I permit you to use my name!

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.120
What the heck?!

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:01.790
You can't change your name!

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:04.030
We'd have to change the show's title!

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.880
Call yourself "New Rock Lee."

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:09.180
And I'll be "Original Rock Lee."

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:10.820
Oh no, I couldn't...

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:12.000
Please, I insist.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.950
Oh no, no, no, I couldn't.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:15.830
Please, please, I insist, I insist...

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.960
Oh no, no, no, I couldn't, I couldn't...

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:21.300
Enough already!

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:25.660
Freeze, you violent femme!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.970
I, Pac Lee, may be a ninja 
that can't use ninjutsu,

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:36.150
but I will not stand by 
while the weak are bullied!

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:39.980
It's getting popular.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:43.570
I'll rip your guts out, you faker!

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:25.210
Next week is "A Hot Night 
for a Chilling Tale,"

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:29.010
<b>A Hot Night for a Chilling Tale
The Hokage Tears Aren't for Decoration.</b>

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:29.010
and "The Hokage Tears 
Aren't for Decoration."

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:30.800
A chilling tale...

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:34.000
Actually, ever since this anime started,

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:36.650
I've always felt like there's 
someone behind me, watching...

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:38.680
Me, too. It gives me the chills...

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:41.290
Maybe there's a ghost 
floating behind us!

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:44.090
One that follows us wherever we go!

00:23:44.090 --> 00:23:46.320
I'm scared!

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:47.940
That's just Yamato Sensei.
